# Voice tests

The `parseTask` create-eval (`voice:eval:create`, intent eval, clarify eval) is removed. Do not recreate it.

Live voice tests are `documentation/voice-agent-dialogue-test-plan.md` and `npm run voice:eval:dialogue`. A write turn is `confirm` (preview cards). Spoken yes is `act`. Prompt rules are in `voice-dialogue-test.mdc`.
